WEBVTT

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:18.340
koi ni naranai ne soba ni iru dake ja

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:18.340
Just being close to you doesn't make love happen.

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:25.590
nazo wo kakete mo donkan na hito dakara

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:25.590
Even if I make a puzzle you can't solve it because you're slow

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:32.750
natsu no fuku wo kite haru no umi ni kita

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:32.750
We came to the spring sea, wearing summer clothes.

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:40.030
anata no SHATSU de yasashiku kabatte

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:40.030
Please cover me gently with your shirt.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.840
My heart iidasenai

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.840
My heart won't let me say

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:47.340
Please KISU shite tte

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:47.340
"Please kiss me."

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.670
Day Dream

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.670
Day Dream...

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:51.000
yume wa fukurami

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:51.000
My dream gets bigger

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:57.150
sora ni takaku kieru

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:57.150
and disappears high in the sky.

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:05.520
onna no ko wa dare datte shiawase ni nareru

00:00:58.090 --> 00:01:05.520
Any girl can be happy.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:12.330
koi ga hajimareba kagayakidasu

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:12.330
When they fall in love, they start shining.

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:19.970
tatoe namida nagashite mo anata no sei nara

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:19.970
Even if the tears start flowing, or my heart aches,

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:27.410
mune wo itamete mo yashiku naru

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:27.410
if it's because of you, she'll become gentler

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:00.870
No.

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:02.320
Don't you understand?

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.620
Why do you think I worked so hard to put this shield up?

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:07.240
I'm sorry,

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:08.830
but I can't let you see onee-sama.

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:17.640
You mentioned a Recall Notice.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:18.670
What does that mean?

00:02:19.170 --> 00:02:21.310
I'm not sure myself.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:25.510
Belldandy apparently wasn't told why, either...

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:29.480
but she just mentioned that something seems to be happening up in the Heavens.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:33.440
That God's orders were not to be disobeyed.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:38.360
OK.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:41.320
I'll ask God directly.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.420
This is Urd. Goddess Second Class, Limited License.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:51.210
Put me through.

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:54.850
Answer me.

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:57.090
Who do you think this is?

00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:59.680
Say something!

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:05.920
It's no use.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.890
I can't connect to the office line.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:24.330
Belldandy.

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:29.170
I'm sorry for the harsh things I said to you earlier.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:36.840
You must have had a good reason to have said what you did.

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:38.670
I'll wait for you.

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:39.510
I'll wait for you.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.930
Whether you return or not.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:47.570
Whether you return or not.

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:02.150
Keiichi-san...

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:52.740
Finally onee-sama and I can go back to the Heavens.

00:04:53.110 --> 00:04:54.820
What are you saying?

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:57.540
If we don't do something the poor girl will just remain depressed.

00:04:58.100 --> 00:04:59.830
Is that OK with you?

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.130
Well....

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:05.520
Well, then, you'll help me out with my plan.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.060
What are you gonna do?

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:13.930
Listen, the Bugs are attracted to the energy sealed in this cherry tree.

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:18.350
If Belldandy is being recalled because of the system imbalance

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:21.400
caused by the Bugs influence...

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:24.630
then if we shut off the energy that's attracting the Bugs,

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.290
the Bugs will stop coming

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:29.630
and the system will be fixed, and Belldandy won't have to return home!

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:31.800
It's killing three birds with one stone!

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:35.340
It's not as simple as that!

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:38.410
For starters, how are you going to break the seal?

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:41.420
From what I've seen, it looks like a pretty powerful one.

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:42.690
Simple,

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:43.950
simple.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:48.680
Hitting the seal with the same type of energy will counter it.

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:51.990
Where are you going to get that kind of energy?

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.640
N-Not the ULT-

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:57.350
Don't talk so loud.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:02.660
It's a serious breach of regulations to use an Ultimate Magic Circle without permission!

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:05.070
What nobody knows can't hurt us.

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:09.170
You just hurry up and produce the matching set point.

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:11.710
Those calculations take an awful lot of time-

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:15.080
Listen, there's only two days left.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:17.610
We've got to do something before the gate opens.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:20.710
I hope this'll be OK...

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.660
Only two days remaining.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:31.100
Thirty more minutes till the next job.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.200
Thank you very much.

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.250
Welcome!

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:47.720
Are you looking for something in particular?

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:50.630
If you'd like, I can take something out.

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.970
This platinum diamond ring is a

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:57.560
new piece for Christmas and is especially popular as a gift for girlfriends.

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.710
What do you think of it?

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.540
I can recommend any of these.

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:32.220
I can just imagine your girlfriend's happy face.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:33.930
N-No thanks.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:36.890
I just came to look today.

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.760
Come again!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:51.990
How's it going?

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:53.700
Think you can come up with something?

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:57.770
You'll be finished with the setup soon, won't you?

00:08:57.770 --> 00:09:02.540
But considering the time we will need to make the actual design, it's cutting it...

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:03.910
What are you doing?

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.090
Bell-Belldandy!

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:11.670
Well uh...

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:13.010
I-It's nothing...

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:18.860
Hey, if you don't hurry up, the sweater won't be ready in time.

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:19.300
Right?

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:19.990
Right?

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:20.950
Yeah...

00:09:28.440 --> 00:09:30.770
That girl's awfully perceptive.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:34.280
Now, shall we continue?

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:37.740
What is it?

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:42.020
I hit the main power switch by accident.

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:45.290
Everything that wasn't backed up is <i>gone</i>!

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.790
What?

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:57.670
Hello, this is the Morisato residence.

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.300
Belldandy...

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.040
it's me.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:02.350
Keiichi-san...

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:05.260
I'm at work now,

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:09.350
and I'll be late so you don't have to make dinner for me.

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.220
I see....

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:14.700
I'm sorry.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:17.000
I want to be close to you, but...

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:21.770
Well, even if I did return, I wouldn't be able to see your face so I guess it's the same thing.

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:24.450
That's true.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.610
Well, see you later.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.370
Keiichi-san, take care.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.170
Keiichi-san, take care.

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:09.790
Belldandy, the kettle!

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:12.470
Oh no!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.570
You're tired, aren't you?

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:21.940
You should get some rest.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:28.160
Keiichi-san.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:36.760
Keiichi?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.220
Oh, my...

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.890
You really do need looking after.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:03.140
This should bring back a little of your stamina.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:08.060
This is all I can do for you though.

00:13:12.170 --> 00:13:13.540
Nee-san?

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.170
Give this to Keiichi-san...

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:23.380
As soon as he came in the door, he was, like, T.K.O.

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:46.530
I want you to stay with me forever.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:51.860
As long as you need me, I'll stay by your side forever.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:52.990
That's right,

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:56.130
I wanted you to be by my side.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.530
Keiichi-san!

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.050
Keiichi-san!

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:02.760
It was fun...

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.940
and...

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:08.880
She even makes me feel like I've known her...

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.800
since childhood!

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.810
Since childhood?

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:18.990
It's a promise.

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:22.650
We must keep promises.

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.740
No matter what.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:27.380
A present...

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.230
<i>It'd really look great on Belldandy.</i>

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:37.300
A ring?

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:39.840
You want a ring?

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:40.960
Yeah.

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:42.360
That time...

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:50.760
I didn't want to see you looking sad.

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:52.990
I...

00:14:58.630 --> 00:14:59.890
I...

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:21.250
His memory is returning.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:28.910
Please,

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:30.710
let it happen in time.

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.760
There's still time left.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.160
Tomorrow, I'll be sure to give it to you...

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.700
so wait till then.

00:15:57.130 --> 00:16:00.460
I swear I'll bring it to you.

00:17:04.950 --> 00:17:07.350
It's done.

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:11.110
Good work!

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:14.070
All that remains is to make the Magic Circle.

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:17.910
Won't onee-sama find out?

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:20.570
That's beside the point.

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:24.200
Listen, we're doing this for Belldandy's sake.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:25.750
Yeah...

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:27.440
that's right.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:29.180
We're doing it for onee-sama.

00:17:29.180 --> 00:17:30.060
Yeah!

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.850
You're beginning to understand!

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:36.170
Besides, it'd be boring if Belldandy went back and I was left here by myself.

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.930
So that's what this is all about!

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:41.320
You're the only one who can't go back,

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:44.890
and you don't want to be left behind so you're getting me to go along with you!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.160
I told you that it's for Belldandy's sake!

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:50.650
All right already!

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:53.110
OK, we're making the Magic Circle!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:18.340
O' things possessing will,

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:21.340
gather together with me...

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:24.310
for the true form of the ultimate one...

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:26.980
let there be light in that which becomes the cornerstone!

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:33.970
The base is finished.

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:37.440
Now I'll enter the program to stabilize the magnetic field.

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:48.370
This is from the school festival.

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:58.510
Keiichi-san forgot his wallet that time.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:01.970
But Keiichi-san received so much from everyone

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.380
saying that they were free,

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:08.520
that he couldn't carry all of them...

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:19.850
It happened just the other day.

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:22.840
It only just started...

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:25.580
nine months...

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:28.540
just nine months of memories,

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.380
but I can't take them with me...

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:34.630
and we'd finally been able to get together.

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:38.950
OK!

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:40.840
Just one more job!

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.160
Please wait.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.340
I'll return in time,

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.490
and I'll be sure to bring it to you.

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.770
God,

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:10.220
please forgive just this.

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:14.910
Even after I disappear from Keiichi-san's life, let at least some form remain.

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:32.580
Only twenty more minutes.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:39.750
Excuse me, please open up.

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:50.470
Sir, we open at ten o'clock so...

00:21:50.470 --> 00:21:52.470
Sir!

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:57.190
Thank goodness, it's still here.

00:21:58.030 --> 00:21:59.230
Excuse me.

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:01.520
Could I get this ¥58,000 one?

00:22:03.950 --> 00:22:05.030
Are you in a hurry?

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:06.130
Yes.

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:07.490
Time's running out.

00:22:10.690 --> 00:22:12.330
That's right...

00:22:12.900 --> 00:22:15.610
today is Christmas Eve.

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:17.910
Very well.

00:22:17.910 --> 00:22:20.390
Just a moment, please.

00:22:24.810 --> 00:22:26.200
This one, right?

00:22:26.200 --> 00:22:30.930
With sales tax, it comes to ¥59,740.

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:34.500
Sir, your change!

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:33.790
Urd!

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:34.910
Skuld!

00:23:35.460 --> 00:23:37.870
What are you two doing?

00:23:38.660 --> 00:23:42.630
Isn't this an Ultimate Magic Circle of Warding?

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:43.920
How could you

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:45.880
make such a thing?

00:23:46.120 --> 00:23:49.620
Listen this is for your and Keiichi's sake!

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:53.380
If we reinforce that seal thing with this Magic Circle

00:23:53.380 --> 00:23:55.860
we can solve the whole problem.

00:23:56.850 --> 00:23:59.390
No you mustn't!

00:23:59.570 --> 00:24:04.350
If God were to find out about this, you two would be punished as well.

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:08.270
Everything will be fine if I alone return.

00:24:08.700 --> 00:24:12.900
Because this is my sin.

00:24:28.580 --> 00:24:31.630
Belldandy!

00:24:35.510 --> 00:24:36.850
Thank goodness.

00:24:36.850 --> 00:24:40.390
I thought we'd never meet again.

00:24:42.280 --> 00:24:44.060
Keiichi-san.

00:25:00.990 --> 00:25:02.860
Belldandy!

00:25:11.410 --> 00:25:12.510
Wait!

00:25:12.510 --> 00:25:13.800
I still haven't...

00:25:13.800 --> 00:25:15.220
Keiichi-san!

00:25:31.950 --> 00:25:32.980
Belldandy!

00:25:36.220 --> 00:25:37.380
Please stop.

00:25:37.380 --> 00:25:38.360
Please stop.

00:25:39.170 --> 00:25:42.620
There's something I've got to give you.

00:25:42.960 --> 00:25:45.160
I made you a promise.

00:25:45.670 --> 00:25:48.540
Keiichi-san, that...

00:25:48.940 --> 00:25:51.960
I didn't forget.

00:25:51.960 --> 00:25:53.790
I remembered.

00:25:53.790 --> 00:25:55.380
Finally, I can give it to you.

00:25:55.380 --> 00:25:58.180
I can finally fulfill the promise I made to you.

00:26:02.600 --> 00:26:04.900
I haven't forgotten either.

00:26:04.900 --> 00:26:06.690
I promised you...

00:26:06.690 --> 00:26:08.400
I promised you twice.

00:26:09.360 --> 00:26:13.530
You tried to keep your promises with all your heart.

00:26:13.530 --> 00:26:15.110
That's why I've

00:26:16.220 --> 00:26:19.580
got to keep <i>my</i> promise!

00:26:21.000 --> 00:26:23.080
Keiichi-san!

00:26:25.950 --> 00:26:27.620
Keiichi-san!

00:26:28.610 --> 00:26:30.090
Wait!

00:26:40.910 --> 00:26:41.930
Belldandy!

00:26:43.960 --> 00:26:48.850
God, please let me stay by Keiichi-san's side.

00:26:49.090 --> 00:26:52.370
To be granted that, I would even give up my goddess qualification.

00:26:52.370 --> 00:26:55.570
I would even accept banishment from the Heavens...

00:26:56.110 --> 00:26:57.720
therefore...

00:26:58.330 --> 00:26:59.570
please.

00:27:04.150 --> 00:27:05.250
It's done!

00:27:05.250 --> 00:27:06.040
Urd!

00:27:06.270 --> 00:27:08.290
I'm starting it up!

00:27:08.290 --> 00:27:12.230
Blaze like flames, race like the wind...

00:27:12.230 --> 00:27:15.920
shake like the water, and receive like the earth!

00:27:17.200 --> 00:27:21.880
I order you in the name of the three goddesses of present, past, and future!

00:27:22.080 --> 00:27:23.510
Arise,

00:27:23.510 --> 00:27:25.600
Ultimate Magic Circle of Warding!

00:27:35.740 --> 00:27:39.770
Belldandy!

00:27:57.810 --> 00:27:58.590
What?

00:27:58.900 --> 00:28:00.550
The gate's vanished?

00:28:00.730 --> 00:28:01.770
Skuld!

00:28:01.770 --> 00:28:03.970
How long are you gonna lie there?

00:28:04.470 --> 00:28:06.510
Ice cream!

00:28:17.250 --> 00:28:18.020
Keiichi-san...

00:28:20.210 --> 00:28:21.980
Keiichi-san!

00:28:32.560 --> 00:28:35.750
No!

00:28:35.940 --> 00:28:37.160
Keiichi-san!

00:28:37.160 --> 00:28:38.000
Keiichi-san!

00:28:38.000 --> 00:28:39.710
Why did this happen?

00:28:40.320 --> 00:28:42.050
Keiichi-san!

00:28:41.270 --> 00:28:42.050
It can't be.

00:28:44.040 --> 00:28:45.780
Is he dead?

00:28:45.780 --> 00:28:46.690
It's OK.

00:28:46.690 --> 00:28:48.050
He's still breathing.

00:28:48.890 --> 00:28:52.610
But his psyche is buried in its own depths,

00:28:52.610 --> 00:28:53.390
if this goes on

00:28:53.670 --> 00:28:55.790
he can't be considered alive.

00:28:55.790 --> 00:28:57.100
I'll...

00:28:57.640 --> 00:28:59.540
I'll go in and bring him back.

00:28:59.540 --> 00:29:00.690
No!

00:29:00.690 --> 00:29:02.140
You can't, onee-sama!

00:29:02.140 --> 00:29:03.960
It's too dangerous!

00:29:03.960 --> 00:29:08.540
If by some chance he responds to an external stimulus you'll...

00:29:10.240 --> 00:29:12.270
Go, Belldandy.

00:29:12.800 --> 00:29:14.620
You've got to go.

00:29:15.140 --> 00:29:17.850
Even if we tried to stop you, you'd still go anyway.

00:29:18.560 --> 00:29:20.340
Be sure to come back.

00:29:21.210 --> 00:29:22.900
Nee-san...

00:29:24.340 --> 00:29:25.800
I will!

00:29:48.360 --> 00:29:49.960
Yes...

00:29:49.960 --> 00:29:51.370
That light.

00:29:57.790 --> 00:30:00.380
Warm and soft light.

00:30:00.760 --> 00:30:04.650
And within that light, there was a girl.

00:30:13.110 --> 00:30:17.730
She introduced herself as Belldandy.

00:30:21.680 --> 00:30:25.870
How mysterious. No human should be able to see that light.

00:30:26.440 --> 00:30:30.240
You must be a friend of nature.

00:30:30.780 --> 00:30:34.910
I never questioned that mysterious encounter.

00:30:41.760 --> 00:30:45.000
That was because she was as natural as the wind.

00:30:46.190 --> 00:30:46.960
A week of summer,

00:30:47.740 --> 00:30:52.390
that was as fulfilling as a year, seemed as short as a day.

00:31:29.550 --> 00:31:32.880
Let's meet here again tomorrow.

00:31:32.880 --> 00:31:34.760
I want to give you something, Bell-chan.

00:31:35.100 --> 00:31:36.610
It's a promise.

00:31:36.610 --> 00:31:38.100
So, let's pinky swear.

00:31:39.910 --> 00:31:40.680
Sure.

00:31:43.460 --> 00:31:46.820
But that was a promise I shouldn't have made...

00:31:48.000 --> 00:31:52.570
a promise forbidden by God when one is on the Surface World.

00:32:01.050 --> 00:32:04.850
Even though to me, a goddess, it was a trifling promise...

00:32:04.850 --> 00:32:07.480
it had the validity of a contract.

00:32:08.150 --> 00:32:10.720
For I, who still didn't have my qualification...

00:32:10.720 --> 00:32:14.770
it meant a serious violation of the regulations.

00:32:17.930 --> 00:32:19.610
If I had known...

00:32:19.610 --> 00:32:22.130
If I had known what it would lead to.

00:32:22.130 --> 00:32:24.480
I wouldn't have made that promise.

00:32:32.930 --> 00:32:36.160
The punishment I received was...

00:32:36.430 --> 00:32:40.040
that I had to erase your memory myself.

00:32:41.210 --> 00:32:43.000
I heard

00:32:43.370 --> 00:32:48.170
that if you didn't erase it, you'd be eliminated for violating regulations.

00:32:48.580 --> 00:32:50.050
That's why I...

00:32:54.720 --> 00:32:57.390
That's why you...

00:32:57.960 --> 00:33:01.140
said, "Erase my memory."

00:33:13.370 --> 00:33:15.830
I'll remember.

00:33:15.830 --> 00:33:17.570
If I meet you again...

00:33:20.450 --> 00:33:23.570
You promised me that...

00:33:23.570 --> 00:33:25.750
but I couldn't promise you.

00:33:26.760 --> 00:33:29.960
But I prayed...

00:33:29.960 --> 00:33:31.020
strongly...

00:33:31.020 --> 00:33:33.010
strongly...

00:33:33.010 --> 00:33:35.190
that if I received my qualification...

00:33:35.190 --> 00:33:37.570
I'd meet you again.

00:33:38.650 --> 00:33:40.720
And that this time I could fulfill my promise.

00:33:43.550 --> 00:33:46.820
And you remembered...

00:33:46.820 --> 00:33:48.400
as you promised.

00:33:49.290 --> 00:33:52.960
Though this memory is fated to disappear.

00:33:53.590 --> 00:33:56.480
You will probably never remember this again.

00:33:58.510 --> 00:34:02.230
But I'm here now.

00:34:02.230 --> 00:34:09.400
And that's the promise I made, and it shall never disappear.

00:34:17.630 --> 00:34:19.680
Keiichi-san.

00:34:25.460 --> 00:34:26.640
Oh yeah.

00:34:26.640 --> 00:34:28.230
The Recall Notice!

00:34:28.590 --> 00:34:32.420
Well, the gate has disappeared...

00:34:32.950 --> 00:34:35.690
but it will return soon.

00:34:47.220 --> 00:34:49.500
It's from God.

00:34:56.480 --> 00:35:00.000
To Belldandy, Goddess First Class, Category 2, Unlimited License.

00:35:00.660 --> 00:35:02.720
That which was sealed away has been eliminated.

00:35:03.120 --> 00:35:07.090
Therefore, we are invalidating the Recall Notice.

00:35:07.090 --> 00:35:08.680
Belldandy...

00:35:20.790 --> 00:35:21.710
Wait a sec!

00:35:21.710 --> 00:35:22.490
There's more.

00:35:22.920 --> 00:35:25.110
And to Urd, Goddess Second Class, Limited License...

00:35:25.110 --> 00:35:30.190
for unauthorized use of the Ultimate Magic Circle of Warding, a thirty day license suspension.

00:35:30.740 --> 00:35:34.250
To Skuld, Goddess Second Class, until the Bug leakage is eliminated...

00:35:34.250 --> 00:35:37.130
modification of status to Surface World Trainee.

00:35:37.940 --> 00:35:38.710
So it is written.

00:35:48.410 --> 00:35:49.650
That's right.

00:35:49.650 --> 00:35:51.950
I needed to give this to Belldandy.

00:35:54.190 --> 00:35:55.820
Belldandy.

00:36:00.280 --> 00:36:05.710
ude wo kunda hishochi no sanpo de

00:36:00.280 --> 00:36:05.710
Taking a stroll at a summer resort, arm in arm,

00:36:05.780 --> 00:36:11.220
guuzen deau CHAPERU no wedding

00:36:05.780 --> 00:36:11.220
we happened to come across a wedding at a chapel.

00:36:11.290 --> 00:36:16.690
asa no kaze ni tokekomu sanbika

00:36:11.290 --> 00:36:16.690
Gospels melting in the morning breeze...

00:36:12.200 --> 00:36:13.580
Thank goodness.

00:36:13.580 --> 00:36:17.030
I thought I wouldn't be able to keep my promise.

00:36:16.760 --> 00:36:21.630
shiawase sou na futari

00:36:16.760 --> 00:36:21.630
A happy looking couple...

00:36:17.030 --> 00:36:18.370
Promise...

00:36:18.370 --> 00:36:19.400
what promise?

00:36:19.400 --> 00:36:21.380
It's OK.

00:36:22.100 --> 00:36:24.660
omedetou! omedetou

00:36:22.100 --> 00:36:24.500
"Congratulations!"

00:36:22.400 --> 00:36:26.220
You kept your promise.

00:36:24.570 --> 00:36:27.400
"Thank you!"

00:36:24.710 --> 00:36:27.400
arigatou! arigatou

00:36:27.470 --> 00:36:33.150
shiroi BU-KE wo sashidasu shinpu

00:36:27.470 --> 00:36:33.100
The bride tosses her white bouquet.

00:36:29.010 --> 00:36:30.440
Thank you.

00:36:31.390 --> 00:36:33.840
Merry Christmas.

00:36:33.170 --> 00:36:39.740
shiawase shiawase 
 wakete ageru

00:36:33.170 --> 00:36:39.740
I will share my happiness with you.

00:36:39.810 --> 00:36:44.680
tonari de hohoemu kare

00:36:39.810 --> 00:36:44.680
The groom smiling next to her.

00:36:44.750 --> 00:36:49.950
futari noseta kuruma ga ugoku to

00:36:44.750 --> 00:36:49.950
When the car carrying the couple starts to move,

00:36:50.020 --> 00:36:55.590
anata ooki na akubi hitotsu

00:36:50.020 --> 00:36:55.590
you let out a big yawn.

00:36:55.660 --> 00:37:01.070
GYUTto ude wo tsunette ageta no

00:36:55.660 --> 00:37:01.070
I pinch your arm...

00:37:01.140 --> 00:37:07.300
omoi ni kidzuku kashira

00:37:01.140 --> 00:37:07.300
I wonder if you even realize how I feel?

00:37:08.200 --> 00:37:15.000
aa kaerimichi TERE nagara

00:37:08.200 --> 00:37:15.000
On the way back, you blushed and said,

00:37:15.100 --> 00:37:20.800
itsuka kimi to kurashitai

00:37:15.100 --> 00:37:20.800
"I want to live with you someday."

00:37:20.900 --> 00:37:26.080
masaka PUROPO-ZU na no?

00:37:20.900 --> 00:37:26.080
Could this be a proposal?

00:37:27.880 --> 00:37:33.310
ude wo kunda hishochi no sanpo de

00:37:27.880 --> 00:37:33.310
Taking a stroll at a summer resort, arm in arm,

00:37:33.380 --> 00:37:38.820
guuzen deau CHAPERU no wedding

00:37:33.380 --> 00:37:38.820
we happened to come across a wedding at a chapel.

00:37:38.890 --> 00:37:44.290
kitto watashi yokan ga shiteta no

00:37:38.890 --> 00:37:44.290
I had a feeling that that was

00:37:44.360 --> 00:37:49.230
mirai wo sasotte-ita

00:37:44.360 --> 00:37:49.230
an invitation to the future.

00:37:53.150 --> 00:37:58.200
eki no FO-MU ressha ga ugoku to

00:37:53.150 --> 00:37:58.200
At the station platform when the train starts moving,

00:37:58.630 --> 00:38:03.750
hanarerarenai futari ni naru

00:37:58.630 --> 00:38:03.750
we can't leave each other.

00:38:04.300 --> 00:38:09.340
anata doko de te ni irete kita no?

00:38:04.300 --> 00:38:09.340
Where did you get it?

00:38:09.410 --> 00:38:14.600
mabushii yubiwa miseta!

00:38:09.410 --> 00:38:14.600
You showed me a shiny ring!

00:38:14.850 --> 00:38:23.050
furueru yubi ni kureta

00:38:14.850 --> 00:38:23.050
And put it on my shaky finger...
